{"sha": "1a61b1eb4a92e368a88db10df543efa75e0b4f6268c14324f4b0f14d99658cf2", "body": ["\\chapter{图形与空间}\\label{ch:g1:shapes}", "", "窗户是长方形，车轮是圆，屋顶上藏着三角形：", "图形无处不在。本章学习通过", "数一数边与角，并准确说出物体\\emph{在哪里}", "：左边、右边、上方、下方、中间。", "", "\\section{四种基本图形}", "", "\\begin{definition}[正方形、长方形、三角形、圆]\\label{def:g1:shapes:def}", "\\begin{itemize}", "  \\item \\emph{三角形}\\index{三角形}有 $3$ 条边和 $3$ 个角；", "  \\item \\emph{正方形}\\index{正方形}有 $4$ 条相等的边和 $4$ 个角；", "  \\item \\emph{长方形}\\index{长方形}有 $4$ 条边和 $4$ 个角，其中", "        对边相等（可以看作拉长的正方形）；", "  \\item \\emph{圆}\\index{圆}是完全圆的：没有边，也没有角。", "\\end{itemize}", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.7]", "  \\draw[thick, fill=omDef!12] (0,0) -- (2,0) -- (1,1.7) -- cycle;", "  \\node[below, align=center, font=\\small] at (1,-0.25)", "    {三角形：\\\\$3$ 条边};", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=3.6cm]", "  \\draw[thick, fill=omThm!12] (0,0) rectangle (1.7,1.7);", "  \\node[below, align=center, font=\\small] at (0.85,-0.25)", "    {正方形：\\\\$4$ 条相等的边};", "  \\end{scope}", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=6.9cm]", "  \\draw[thick, fill=omMeth!12] (0,0.05) rectangle (2.8,1.65);", "  \\node[below, align=center, font=\\small] at (1.4,-0.25)", "    {长方形：\\\\$4$ 条边};", "  \\end{scope}", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=11.3cm]", "  \\draw[thick, fill=omProp!12] (0.9,0.85) circle (0.9);", "  \\node[below, align=center, font=\\small] at (0.9,-0.25)", "    {圆：\\\\没有角};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 四种基本图形。要说出一个图形的名称，不要只凭", "第一眼，要\\emph{数一数}它的边和角。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[倾斜的图形仍是图形]\\label{ex:g1:shapes:tilted}", "立在角上的正方形仍然是正方形 --- 四条边相等、", "四个角 --- 即使它看起来像筝形。转动一个", "图形不会改变它是什么。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{example}[找图形]\\label{ex:g1:shapes:hunt}", "在教室里：黑板是长方形，挂钟是圆，一块", "折起的餐巾可以是三角形，有些窗户是正方形。真实", "物体并不是完美的图形，但它们的面接近这些图形", "（立体图形及其面在\\cref{ch:g2:shapes}中再次出现）。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{它在哪里？}", "", "\\begin{definition}[位置词]\\label{def:g1:shapes:position}", "说明某物在哪里，可用 \\emph{左边} / \\emph{右边}，", "\\emph{上方} / \\emph{下方}，\\emph{在……上} / \\emph{在……下}，", "\\emph{在……前面} / \\emph{在……后面}，\\emph{在……之间}，", "\\emph{在……里面} / \\emph{在……外面}。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.75]", "  \\draw[thick, fill=omDef!12] (0,0) circle (0.55);", "  \\draw[thick, fill=omThm!12] (1.9,-0.55) rectangle (3.0,0.55);", "  \\draw[thick, fill=omMeth!12] (4.4,-0.5) -- (5.5,-0.5) -- (4.95,0.45)", "    -- cycle;", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (0,-0.75) {圆};", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (2.45,-0.75) {正方形};", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (4.95,-0.75) {三角形};", "  \\node[right, font=\\small, align=left] at (6.3,0)", "    {正方形在圆和三角形\\emph{之间}；\\\\", "    圆在正方形的\\emph{左边}};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 位置词的运用。注意：\\emph{你自己}的左边和", "面对你的人的左边正好相反！}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{方格纸上的路线}", "", "\\begin{method}[描述路线]\\label{met:g1:shapes:path}", "在方格纸上，路线是一串步骤：", "$\\to$（向右一格），$\\leftarrow$（向左一格），$\\uparrow$（向上一格），", "$\\downarrow$（向下一格）。", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 沿路线走：从标记的方格出发，", "        依次按箭头的方向走；", "  \\item 描述路线：在脑中走一遍，", "        按顺序写下箭头；", "  \\item 两条不同的路线可以连接同样的两个方格 --- 有的较短，", "        有的较长。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.6]", "  \\draw[gray!40] (0,0) grid (7,4);", "  \\fill[omDef!40] (0.5,0.5) +(-0.42,-0.42) rectangle +(0.42,0.42);", "  \\node[font=\\footnotesize] at (0.5,0.5) {起点};", "  \\fill[omThm!40] (5.5,2.5) +(-0.42,-0.42) rectangle +(0.42,0.42);", "  \\node[font=\\footnotesize] at (5.5,2.5) {终点};", "  % seven unit arrows, one per step, with small gaps", "  \\foreach \\a/\\b in {0.5/1.5, 1.5/2.5}", "    \\draw[-Stealth, omDef, very thick] (\\a+0.1,0.5) -- (\\b-0.1,0.5);", "  \\foreach \\a/\\b in {0.5/1.5, 1.5/2.5}", "    \\draw[-Stealth, omDef, very thick] (2.5,\\a+0.1) -- (2.5,\\b-0.1);", "  \\foreach \\a/\\b in {2.5/3.5, 3.5/4.5}", "    \\draw[-Stealth, omDef, very thick] (\\a+0.1,2.5) -- (\\b-0.1,2.5);", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omDef, very thick] (4.6,2.5) -- (5.05,2.5);", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}